The build files in this directory (moz.build, jar.mn, configure.sh, prefs,
CSS, NSIS and manifest files) are derived from Mozilla's browser/branding
templates and are under the MPL 2, as below.

The Amaya name, the Amaya rising-stroke logo and the artwork in this directory are
original to the Amaya project (sources in branding/source/). They are not
Mozilla trademarks, and no Mozilla trademark or logo is used here. A trademark
search on "Amaya" is still pending; do not treat the name as cleared.

The wordmark and the "PDF" label are drawn from Inter (SIL Open Font License
1.1, https://openfontlicense.org), converted to outlines.

